- For each $i \in I$, let $x_i$ = number of units of product $i$ to fulfill. ($x_i \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0}$)

**Parameters:**
- $r_i$ = Revenue per unit of product $i$ (from Revenue column)
- $d_i$ = Demand for product $i$ (from Demand column)
